This is a dashboard similar to one I created in practice, aimed at monitoring and optimizing the performance of a delivery vehicle fleet.

The tables were designed based on real-world logistics experience, and I generated the code in Python with the help of ChatGPT.
Please excuse the lack of database logic — many values are randomly generated for the demo.

This dashboard provides a comprehensive view of key indicators, focusing on:

✅ Cost tracking over time, enabling more accurate budgeting for upcoming periods
✅ Number of completed routes and total mileage, as core indicators of fleet workload
✅ Cost per kilometer and value transported per kilometer, for evaluating vehicle utilization efficiency
✅ Driver performance monitoring, based on productivity and consistency
✅ Route optimization, including suggestions for scaling up/down or excluding underperforming routes

Ultimately, this dashboard serves as a decision-support tool, helping identify cost-saving opportunities and streamline logistics operations.

